// The junctions of examples/traffic/town.ent (lights, a roundabout, a
// priority road and stops on every street), ten minutes each with more
// cars than the lights and the stops let through: none stands on the car
// ahead, no two on paths that cross, join or split come within 2.5 m of
// each other, and none of the junctions locks up. The same on one core
// and on all of them.
// RUN: %ent run -I %S/../../examples/traffic %S/Inputs/traffic_town.ent 2>/dev/null > %t.one
// RUN: %ent run --parallel -I %S/../../examples/traffic %S/Inputs/traffic_town.ent 2>/dev/null > %t.all
// RUN: cmp %t.one %t.all
// RUN: FileCheck %s < %t.one

// CHECK: scene 0: {{1[0-9][0-9]}} through, 0 overlaps, 0 close
// CHECK: scene 1: {{[23][0-9][0-9]}} through, 0 overlaps, 0 close
// CHECK: scene 2: {{1[0-9][0-9]}} through, 0 overlaps, 0 close
// CHECK: scene 3: {{1[0-9][0-9]}} through, 0 overlaps, 0 close
